# Sentinel Ultra — Harbor Structure

## Layout

```text
<task>/
├── instruction.md
├── task.toml
├── environment/
│   ├── Dockerfile
│   ├── repo/                 # NEVER edit tracked source files
│   └── problem_statement.md  # MUST be exact copy of instruction.md
├── solution/
│   ├── solve.sh              # applies golden.patch
│   └── golden.patch          # rename solution.patch → golden.patch if needed
└── tests/
    ├── test.sh
    ├── tests.patch           # fail-to-pass tests live here
    └── config.json           # execution + fail_to_pass / pass_to_pass ids
```

`runs/` may sit beside the task for reference. **Do not include `runs/` in upload zips.**

## Naming

- Gold patch file is **`golden.patch`** (not `init_state.patch`).
- Old reverse-patch model is obsolete: oracle **applies** `golden.patch`, it does not reverse `init_state.patch`.

## `config.json` (required shape)

- `grading.fail_to_pass` — non-empty; **≥10** test ids
- `grading.pass_to_pass` — regression guard
- Never modify pre-existing p2p test files; add new f2p via `tests.patch` only
- `tests.patch` must apply cleanly at `base_commit_sha`

## `task.toml` limits (check every task)

| Field | Constraint |
|-------|------------|
| `cpus` | 2 or 4 |
| `memory_mb` | 2048–16384 |
| `storage_mb` | 5120–10240 |
| `gpus` | always 0 |
| `build_timeout_sec` | max 1800 |
| `[agent] timeout_sec` | max 7200 (raise if agents time out) |
| `[verifier] timeout_sec` | max 1800 |

**network_mode (required — do not strip):**

- `[environment]` → `"public"`
- `[agent]` → `"allowlist"` with `allowed_hosts = ["api.portkey.ai"]`
- `[verifier]` → `"no-network"`
- Remove `network_mode = "none"` from `docker_compose.yaml` if present

Also verify: `source`, `category`, `difficulty_explanation`, `schema_version`.
